{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t保安局「口岸通」網頁顯示，截至凌晨12時30分，皇崗口岸出入境平均輪候時間轉為繁忙，當中出境的訪港旅客，在出境大堂內的平均輪候時間約為45分鐘，香港居民的出境平均輪候時間約為25分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:09.309163+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T16:28:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:46.730644+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:15.777054+00:00","content_hash":"71aa50bd76885220e6369d218f08455cdb4aa1c33fb837111e8d6abac4fa6951","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}